<title>UK: BT shareholders back $20 bln MCI buy.</title>
<headline>BT shareholders back $20 bln MCI buy.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Telecommunications Plc's 2.3 million shareholders overwhelmingly backed its ambitious $20 billion merger with MCI Communications Corp , America's second long distance carrier.</p>
</text>
